{"name": "bracket-sheet-en", "lang": "en", "prompt": "Draw a drawing sheet for an L-bracket on an A4 sheet at 1:1 in third-angle projection, with front, left side and top views. The bracket is 80 mm wide, 60 mm high and 40 mm deep, of 5 mm plate. Dimension the width, height and depth. Add a bill of materials — part 1, Bracket, 1 off, steel S235 — and balloon it.", "sheet": {"scale": 1, "views": ["front", "left|right", "top"], "parts": 1, "balloons": 1, "datums": [{"axis": "height", "value": 60, "views": 2}], "dimensions": [80, 60, 40]}, "example": [{"op": "title_block", "paper": "A4", "scale": 1, "title": "L-BRACKET", "projection": "third", "at": [0, 0]}, {"op": "datum", "name": "height", "axis": "height", "value": 60, "views": ["front", "side"]}, {"op": "datum", "name": "depth", "axis": "depth", "value": 40}, {"op": "view", "id": "front", "placed": "principal", "operations": [{"op": "polyline", "points": [[0, 0], [80, 0], [80, 5], [5, 5], [5, {"datum": "height"}], [0, {"datum": "height"}]], "closed": true}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [80, 0]], "side": "below"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, {"datum": "height"}]], "side": "left"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "side", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_left", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [{"datum": "depth"}, 0], "opposite": [0, {"datum": "height"}]}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[-40, 0], [0, 0]], "side": "below"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "top", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_above", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [80, {"datum": "depth"}]}]}, {"op": "bill_of_materials", "parts": [{"number": 1, "name": "Bracket", "quantity": 1, "material": "Steel S235"}]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 1, "view": "front", "at": [40, 5], "to": [60, 30]}]}
{"name": "spillway-sheet-en", "lang": "en", "prompt": "Generate a 2D CAD drawing sheet for a concrete dam spillway H02 with an ogee crest and a stilling basin. Coordinates in metres, dimensions in mm. Single overflow bay, clear width 10000 mm, sidewalls 600 mm thick, internal faces Y=0 and Y=10 m. Crest at X=0, elevation +110.000 m; downstream profile through (0,110), (2,109.5), (5,107.5), (8,104.5), (12,100), (16,96), (20,92), an interpolating spline. Stilling basin from X=20 to X=40 m, floor at +92.000 m, length 20000 mm, three baffle blocks 1000 × 1000 × 1000 mm at X=28–29 m, Y=1.5–2.5, 4.5–5.5 and 7.5–8.5 m, end sill at X=39.5–40 m with its top at +93.000 m, apron X=40–44 m. Views: a top plan; longitudinal section A-A along the centreline; transverse section B-B at X=28.5 m; an upstream elevation; an enlarged end-sill detail. Concrete hatching, dimensions of the clear width and the basin length, section markers and a title block.", "sheet": {"view_count": 5, "sections": 2, "views": ["section"], "dimensions": [10000, 20000]}, "example": [{"op": "title_block", "paper": "A1", "scale": 100, "title": "SPILLWAY H02", "projection": "first", "at": [0, 0]}, {"op": "view", "id": "plan", "title": "PLAN", "placed": "principal", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [44000, 10000]}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [20000, 0], [40000, 0]], "side": "below"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, 10000]], "side": "left"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "aa", "placed": "section", "cut": {"of": "plan", "from": [-1000, 5000], "to": [45000, 5000], "toward": [22000, 10000]}, "operations": [{"op": "spline", "points": [[0, 18000], [2000, 17500], [5000, 15500], [8000, 12500], [12000, 8000], [16000, 4000], [20000, 0]]}, {"op": "line", "points": [[20000, 0], [44000, 0]]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "bb", "placed": "section", "cut": {"of": "plan", "from": [28500, -1000], "to": [28500, 11000], "toward": [40000, 5000]}, "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [10000, 1000]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "upstream", "title": "UPSTREAM ELEVATION", "placed": "free", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [11200, 20000]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "sill", "title": "END SILL DETAIL", "placed": "free", "ratio": 0.05, "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [500, 1000]}]}]}
{"name": "armour-sheet-en", "lang": "en", "prompt": "Generate an editable 2D mechanical specification sheet for a powered armour suit, MK-III, in mm, orthographic only. Overall height 1950, shoulder width 760, torso width 560, waist 440, helmet 300 W × 360 H × 300 D, chest depth 340, reactor housing Ø130 with rings Ø90 and Ø45. Views: a full-body front elevation with dimensions, a side elevation, a rear elevation, and a chest cross-section A-A through the reactor. Numbered parts with a bill of materials (helmet, chest plate, pauldrons, forearm shells, internal frame), balloons on the parts, material notes and a title block. Where shapes are not given, draw them schematically and say so.", "sheet": {"views": ["front", "left|right", "rear", "section"], "parts": 5, "balloons": 3, "datums": [{"axis": "height", "value": 1950, "views": 3}], "dimensions": [1950, 760]}, "example": [{"op": "title_block", "paper": "A1", "scale": 5, "title": "MK-III ARMOUR", "projection": "third", "at": [0, 0]}, {"op": "datum", "name": "top", "axis": "height", "value": 1950, "views": ["front", "side", "rear"]}, {"op": "view", "id": "front", "placed": "principal", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [760, {"datum": "top"}]}, {"op": "circle", "center": [380, 1400], "radius": 65}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [760, 0]], "side": "below"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, {"datum": "top"}]], "side": "left"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "side", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_left", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [-340, 0], "opposite": [0, {"datum": "top"}]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "rear", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_behind", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [-760, 0], "opposite": [0, {"datum": "top"}]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "chest", "placed": "section", "cut": {"of": "front", "from": [-50, 1400], "to": [810, 1400], "toward": [380, 1900]}, "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [560, 340]}]}, {"op": "bill_of_materials", "parts": [{"number": 1, "name": "Helmet", "quantity": 1, "material": "Titanium alloy"}, {"number": 2, "name": "Chest plate", "quantity": 1, "material": "Titanium alloy"}, {"number": 3, "name": "Pauldron", "quantity": 2, "material": "Titanium alloy"}, {"number": 4, "name": "Forearm shell", "quantity": 2, "material": "Titanium alloy"}, {"number": 5, "name": "Internal frame", "quantity": 1, "material": "TBD"}]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 1, "view": "front", "at": [380, 1900], "to": [600, 2050]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 2, "view": "front", "at": [380, 1300], "to": [900, 1300]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 5, "view": "front", "at": [380, 800], "to": [900, 800]}]}
{"name": "bracket-sheet-pt", "lang": "pt", "prompt": "Desenhe uma folha de desenho de uma cantoneira em L numa folha A4 na escala 1:1, no terceiro diedro, com vistas frontal, lateral esquerda e superior. A cantoneira tem 80 mm de largura, 60 mm de altura e 40 mm de profundidade, em chapa de 5 mm. Cote a largura, a altura e a profundidade. Inclua uma lista de materiais — peça 1, Cantoneira, 1 unidade, aço S235 — e indique-a com um balão.", "sheet": {"scale": 1, "views": ["front", "left|right", "top"], "parts": 1, "balloons": 1, "datums": [{"axis": "height", "value": 60, "views": 2}], "dimensions": [80, 60, 40]}, "example": [{"op": "title_block", "paper": "A4", "scale": 1, "title": "L-BRACKET", "projection": "third", "at": [0, 0]}, {"op": "datum", "name": "height", "axis": "height", "value": 60, "views": ["front", "side"]}, {"op": "datum", "name": "depth", "axis": "depth", "value": 40}, {"op": "view", "id": "front", "placed": "principal", "operations": [{"op": "polyline", "points": [[0, 0], [80, 0], [80, 5], [5, 5], [5, {"datum": "height"}], [0, {"datum": "height"}]], "closed": true}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [80, 0]], "side": "below"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, {"datum": "height"}]], "side": "left"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "side", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_left", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [{"datum": "depth"}, 0], "opposite": [0, {"datum": "height"}]}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[-40, 0], [0, 0]], "side": "below"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "top", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_above", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [80, {"datum": "depth"}]}]}, {"op": "bill_of_materials", "parts": [{"number": 1, "name": "Bracket", "quantity": 1, "material": "Steel S235"}]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 1, "view": "front", "at": [40, 5], "to": [60, 30]}]}
{"name": "spillway-sheet-pt", "lang": "pt", "prompt": "Gere uma folha de desenho CAD 2D de um vertedouro H02 de barragem de concreto, com soleira em perfil Creager e bacia de dissipação. Coordenadas em metros, cotas em mm. Um único vão livre, largura livre de 10000 mm, muros laterais de 600 mm, faces internas em Y=0 e Y=10 m. Soleira em X=0, cota +110,000 m; perfil de jusante pelos pontos (0,110), (2,109,5), (5,107,5), (8,104,5), (12,100), (16,96), (20,92), uma spline interpoladora. Bacia de dissipação de X=20 a X=40 m, fundo na cota +92,000 m, comprimento de 20000 mm, três blocos amortecedores de 1000 × 1000 × 1000 mm em X=28–29 m, Y=1,5–2,5, 4,5–5,5 e 7,5–8,5 m, soleira terminal em X=39,5–40 m com topo na cota +93,000 m, laje de proteção de X=40 a 44 m. Vistas: planta; corte longitudinal A-A pelo eixo; corte transversal B-B em X=28,5 m; elevação de montante; detalhe ampliado da soleira terminal. Hachura de concreto, cotas da largura livre e do comprimento da bacia, marcas de corte e carimbo.", "sheet": {"view_count": 5, "sections": 2, "views": ["section"], "dimensions": [10000, 20000]}, "example": [{"op": "title_block", "paper": "A1", "scale": 100, "title": "SPILLWAY H02", "projection": "first", "at": [0, 0]}, {"op": "view", "id": "plan", "title": "PLAN", "placed": "principal", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [44000, 10000]}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [20000, 0], [40000, 0]], "side": "below"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, 10000]], "side": "left"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "aa", "placed": "section", "cut": {"of": "plan", "from": [-1000, 5000], "to": [45000, 5000], "toward": [22000, 10000]}, "operations": [{"op": "spline", "points": [[0, 18000], [2000, 17500], [5000, 15500], [8000, 12500], [12000, 8000], [16000, 4000], [20000, 0]]}, {"op": "line", "points": [[20000, 0], [44000, 0]]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "bb", "placed": "section", "cut": {"of": "plan", "from": [28500, -1000], "to": [28500, 11000], "toward": [40000, 5000]}, "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [10000, 1000]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "upstream", "title": "UPSTREAM ELEVATION", "placed": "free", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [11200, 20000]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "sill", "title": "END SILL DETAIL", "placed": "free", "ratio": 0.05, "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [500, 1000]}]}]}
{"name": "armour-sheet-pt", "lang": "pt", "prompt": "Gere uma folha de especificação mecânica 2D editável de uma armadura motorizada, MK-III, em mm, apenas vistas ortográficas. Altura total 1950, largura dos ombros 760, tronco 560, cintura 440, capacete 300 L × 360 A × 300 P, profundidade do peito 340, alojamento do reator Ø130 com anéis Ø90 e Ø45. Vistas: elevação frontal de corpo inteiro com cotas, elevação lateral, elevação posterior e corte A-A do peito pelo reator. Peças numeradas com lista de materiais (capacete, placa do peito, ombreiras, carcaças dos antebraços, estrutura interna), balões nas peças, notas de material e carimbo. Onde as formas não forem dadas, desenhe-as de forma esquemática e diga isso.", "sheet": {"views": ["front", "left|right", "rear", "section"], "parts": 5, "balloons": 3, "datums": [{"axis": "height", "value": 1950, "views": 3}], "dimensions": [1950, 760]}, "example": [{"op": "title_block", "paper": "A1", "scale": 5, "title": "MK-III ARMOUR", "projection": "third", "at": [0, 0]}, {"op": "datum", "name": "top", "axis": "height", "value": 1950, "views": ["front", "side", "rear"]}, {"op": "view", "id": "front", "placed": "principal", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [760, {"datum": "top"}]}, {"op": "circle", "center": [380, 1400], "radius": 65}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [760, 0]], "side": "below"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, {"datum": "top"}]], "side": "left"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "side", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_left", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [-340, 0], "opposite": [0, {"datum": "top"}]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "rear", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_behind", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [-760, 0], "opposite": [0, {"datum": "top"}]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "chest", "placed": "section", "cut": {"of": "front", "from": [-50, 1400], "to": [810, 1400], "toward": [380, 1900]}, "operations": [