{"name": "pump-sheet-en", "lang": "en", "prompt": "Draw a specification sheet for a horizontal end-suction centrifugal pump set, in mm, on an A3 sheet at 1:5 in first-angle projection. Baseplate 600 long, 300 wide and 40 thick; shaft centreline 250 above the floor; volute casing Ø300; motor 280 long and Ø200; overall height 420 to the top of the discharge nozzle. Views: a front elevation, a side view from the left, a plan from above, and section A-A along the shaft. Number the parts in a bill of materials — casing, impeller, shaft, motor, baseplate — balloon the casing, the motor and the baseplate, and dimension the baseplate's length, the shaft height and the overall height. Where shapes are not given, draw them schematically and say so.", "sheet": {"scale": 5, "views": ["front", "left|right", "top", "section"], "sections": 1, "parts": 5, "balloons": 3, "datums": [{"axis": "height", "value": 250, "views": 2}, {"axis": "height", "value": 420, "views": 2}], "dimensions": [600, 250, 420]}, "example": [{"op": "title_block", "paper": "A3", "scale": 5, "title": "PUMP SET", "projection": "first", "at": [0, 0]}, {"op": "dim_scale", "scale": 5}, {"op": "datum", "name": "shaft", "axis": "height", "value": 250, "views": ["front", "side"]}, {"op": "datum", "name": "top", "axis": "height", "value": 420, "views": ["front", "side"]}, {"op": "view", "id": "front", "placed": "principal", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [600, 40]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [125, 40], "opposite": [225, 100]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [100, 100], "opposite": [250, 400]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [130, 400], "opposite": [220, {"datum": "top"}]}, {"op": "line", "points": [[250, {"datum": "shaft"}], [300, {"datum": "shaft"}]]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [320, 40], "opposite": [560, 150]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [300, 150], "opposite": [580, 350]}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [600, 0]], "side": "below"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, {"datum": "shaft"}]], "side": "left"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, {"datum": "top"}]], "side": "left"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "side", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_left", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [-300, 0], "opposite": [0, 40]}, {"op": "circle", "center": [-150, {"datum": "shaft"}], "radius": 150}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [-195, 400], "opposite": [-105, {"datum": "top"}]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "plan", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_above", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [600, 300]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [100, 75], "opposite": [250, 225]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [300, 50], "opposite": [580, 250]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "aa", "placed": "section", "cut": {"of": "plan", "from": [-20, 150], "to": [620, 150], "toward": [300, 0]}, "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [100, 100], "opposite": [250, 400]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [115, 115], "opposite": [235, 385]}, {"op": "hatch", "inside": [107, 250], "pattern": "ANSI31", "scale": 5}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [235, 240], "opposite": [300, 260]}]}, {"op": "bill_of_materials", "parts": [{"number": 1, "name": "Casing", "quantity": 1, "material": "Cast iron"}, {"number": 2, "name": "Impeller", "quantity": 1, "material": "Bronze"}, {"number": 3, "name": "Shaft", "quantity": 1, "material": "Stainless steel"}, {"number": 4, "name": "Motor", "quantity": 1, "material": ""}, {"number": 5, "name": "Baseplate", "quantity": 1, "material": "Steel S235"}]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 1, "view": "front", "at": [175, 300], "to": [60, 330]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 4, "view": "front", "at": [440, 350], "to": [440, 400]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 5, "view": "front", "at": [500, 20], "to": [640, 80]}]}
{"name": "pump-sheet-pt", "lang": "pt", "prompt": "Desenhe uma folha de especificação de um conjunto motobomba centrífuga horizontal de sucção frontal, em mm, numa folha A3 na escala 1:5, no primeiro diedro. Base de 600 de comprimento, 300 de largura e 40 de espessura; eixo a 250 acima do piso; voluta Ø300; motor de 280 de comprimento e Ø200; altura total de 420 até o topo do bocal de recalque. Vistas: elevação frontal, vista lateral pela esquerda, planta vista de cima e corte A-A ao longo do eixo. Numere as peças numa lista de materiais — voluta, rotor, eixo, motor, base — coloque balões na voluta, no motor e na base, e cote o comprimento da base, a altura do eixo e a altura total. Onde as formas não forem dadas, desenhe-as de forma esquemática e diga isso.", "sheet": {"scale": 5, "views": ["front", "left|right", "top", "section"], "sections": 1, "parts": 5, "balloons": 3, "datums": [{"axis": "height", "value": 250, "views": 2}, {"axis": "height", "value": 420, "views": 2}], "dimensions": [600, 250, 420]}, "example": [{"op": "title_block", "paper": "A3", "scale": 5, "title": "PUMP SET", "projection": "first", "at": [0, 0]}, {"op": "dim_scale", "scale": 5}, {"op": "datum", "name": "shaft", "axis": "height", "value": 250, "views": ["front", "side"]}, {"op": "datum", "name": "top", "axis": "height", "value": 420, "views": ["front", "side"]}, {"op": "view", "id": "front", "placed": "principal", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [600, 40]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [125, 40], "opposite": [225, 100]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [100, 100], "opposite": [250, 400]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [130, 400], "opposite": [220, {"datum": "top"}]}, {"op": "line", "points": [[250, {"datum": "shaft"}], [300, {"datum": "shaft"}]]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [320, 40], "opposite": [560, 150]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [300, 150], "opposite": [580, 350]}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [600, 0]], "side": "below"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, {"datum": "shaft"}]], "side": "left"}, {"op": "dim_chain", "points": [[0, 0], [0, {"datum": "top"}]], "side": "left"}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "side", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_left", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [-300, 0], "opposite": [0, 40]}, {"op": "circle", "center": [-150, {"datum": "shaft"}], "radius": 150}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [-195, 400], "opposite": [-105, {"datum": "top"}]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "plan", "placed": "projected", "of": "front", "looking": "from_above", "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [0, 0], "opposite": [600, 300]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [100, 75], "opposite": [250, 225]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [300, 50], "opposite": [580, 250]}]}, {"op": "view", "id": "aa", "placed": "section", "cut": {"of": "plan", "from": [-20, 150], "to": [620, 150], "toward": [300, 0]}, "operations": [{"op": "rectangle", "corner": [100, 100], "opposite": [250, 400]}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [115, 115], "opposite": [235, 385]}, {"op": "hatch", "inside": [107, 250], "pattern": "ANSI31", "scale": 5}, {"op": "rectangle", "corner": [235, 240], "opposite": [300, 260]}]}, {"op": "bill_of_materials", "parts": [{"number": 1, "name": "Casing", "quantity": 1, "material": "Cast iron"}, {"number": 2, "name": "Impeller", "quantity": 1, "material": "Bronze"}, {"number": 3, "name": "Shaft", "quantity": 1, "material": "Stainless steel"}, {"number": 4, "name": "Motor", "quantity": 1, "material": ""}, {"number": 5, "name": "Baseplate", "quantity": 1, "material": "Steel S235"}]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 1, "view": "front", "at": [175, 300], "to": [60, 330]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 4, "view": "front", "at": [440, 350], "to": [440, 400]}, {"op": "balloon", "part": 5, "view": "front", "at": [500, 20], "to": [640, 80]}]}
